    "near_duplicate_global_and_benchmark_holdout_status_reported_separately_without_claiming_global_clearance"
  ],
  "source_scoped_training_scope_note": "A source-scoped partition may be training_eligible=true while global G-0 remains FAIL only when every source-specific requirement above passes. This does not grant global corpus admission, near-duplicate clearance, or benchmark/holdout clearance. Global corpus training/admission still requires G-0 PASS.",
